{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This horror game is impossible for cowards to beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Don't Drop The Cake&quot; is a horror game where you must carry a wobbly cake while navigating a space infested with terrifying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No matter how hard you try to hide your fear, it's obvious</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you say, &quot;Fear is not in my vocabulary,&quot; deep down, you might be scared. In this game, you must use your mouse to balance the cake and prevent it from falling. If your hands start to shake or you panic, the cake will fall, and your fear will be exposed for everyone to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Unique and Terrifying Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll encounter uniquely designed, terrifying creatures unlike anything you've seen before. Use your wits and courage to avoid getting caught by them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story where mysteries are gradually revealed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you carrying a cake? Where are you heading? What is this place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, uncover many mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regarding Video Streaming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3160640?t=1768118865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3160640?t=1768118865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160640/41c10b6ad4378facf1ad6340009bedd0a0b6170f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768118865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160640/41c10b6ad4378facf1ad6340009bedd0a0b6170f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768118865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mild bloodshed."},"demos":[{"appid":3786010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This horror game is impossible for cowards to beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Don't Drop The Cake&quot; is a horror game where you must carry a wobbly cake while navigating a space infested with terrifying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No matter how hard you try to hide your fear, it's obvious</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you say, &quot;Fear is not in my vocabulary,&quot; deep down, you might be scared. In this game, you must use your mouse to balance the cake and prevent it from falling. If your hands start to shake or you panic, the cake will fall, and your fear will be exposed for everyone to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Unique and Terrifying Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll encounter uniquely designed, terrifying creatures unlike anything you've seen before. Use your wits and courage to avoid getting caught by them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story where mysteries are gradually revealed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you carrying a cake? Where are you heading? What is this place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, uncover many mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regarding Video Streaming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream.</p>","developers":["Midoriyama"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"descri